# Orchestrator Plan ([PROJECT_NAME])

Read when:

1. turning an accepted audit or operator request into bounded work,
2. reviewing the next implementation step before packet issuance,
3. resuming orchestrated work after interruption,
4. deciding whether auto-continue is allowed.

Skip when:

1. the project is not using the orchestrator profile, or
2. a worker already has an active packet and no planning decision is needed.

## Purpose

This is the rolling written plan artifact for orchestrated work.

It translates plain-language operator intent and accepted audit facts into the next safe packet.
It is the approval bridge between audit and worker execution.

The operator should be able to understand the plan without reading raw diffs, packet schemas, or code.

