## Update Rules

Update this same file when:

1. an audit is accepted or repaired,
2. the next packet changes,
3. reviewer returns REPAIR, REJECT, or ESCALATE,
4. operator approval changes the backlog or auto-continue setting,
5. orchestrated work pauses or resumes.

Do not create competing plan summaries when this file exists.
Repair this same artifact so the operator and models have one current planning truth.
